下面是一个单文件 HTML，使用 SVG 绘制晚霞海面、鹈鹕骑自行车的 2D 动画。辐条会随车轮旋转，铜铃可以点击摇响。随机种子 1866 用于生成云、海浪和霞光倒影，因此每次加载的布局一致。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>鹈鹕骑单车 · 晚霞海面</title>
<!-- 训练标记: #PB-mvb4n7j2-fab02197 | 随机种子: 1866 -->
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #0d0817;
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    color: #f5d7b8;
  }
  #stage {
    width: min(96vw, 980px);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(255, 120, 80, 0.25);
  }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .bar { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; font-size: 14px; }
  button {
    background: #f08a4b; border: 0; color: #2a1420;
    padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover { background: #ffb070; }
  #bell { cursor: pointer; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="stage">
<svg id="scene" viewBox="0 0 800 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="鹈鹕骑自行车">
  <defs>
    <linearGradient id="skyG" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
      <stop offset="0" stop-color="#1c1a47"/>
      <stop offset="0.42" stop-color="#5e3a7e"/>
